{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act42side_level_act42side_st04",
  "groupId": "act42side",
  "stageId": "act42side_st04",
  "title": "遠行",
  "storyCode": "MT-ST-4",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act42side/level_act42side_st04.txt",
  "sourceHash": "327ed8c430bc795021b449b90288ad60f6d46a79741c6b3c502c627f836033ef",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "61_g10_fadedbalcony"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你終於確定，現實中那場聲勢浩大的遷徙已經結束。\n遷徙的結果同樣映射在了你們所在的空間——那道彷彿被天災犁過的鴻溝橫亙在大教堂前。鴻溝旁，是一個更醒目的深坑。\n在這本應靜滯的城市，它們像是醜陋的疤痕。\n而環形的機器在其中沉默——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "PCS系統……當機了？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你看向普瑞賽斯，她依舊冷靜，似乎毫不在意這場意外。\n你感到了不安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "分析確認完畢！十個標準秒之前，大教堂廣場發生了至少兩次當量驚人的爆炸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "實施者基本可以確定為能天使、送葬人和另一個銀髮薩科塔。爆炸點附近不斷閃動的定格畫面足以佐證這一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我們幫能天使做的程式炸彈奏效了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
              "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "現在還沒到慶祝的時候，博士！"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
              "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "（普瑞賽斯還沒有下一步的動作。）"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
              "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "（無論如何，我們必須想辦法阻止她改寫局面。）"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "但那台機器的結構不該如此脆弱。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
              "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "沒錯。它的結構絕對能扛住天使們所能製造的任何衝擊能量，畢竟它是以能在更嚴酷的環境中運作而被設計的。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
              "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "（普瑞賽斯理應有能力重啟PCS系統。必須阻止她。）"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼，抱歉，博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我應該獨自過來執行這次任務，儘量不讓你涉險的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你已經習慣站在我身前了，Mon3tr。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "（微笑）",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "謝謝。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "事情的發展也許沒有你想得那麼壞。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我現在已經可以確認普瑞賽斯的狀態了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她的……狀態？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你越過Mon3tr走向了普瑞賽斯，Mon3tr瞬間緊張起來，拉住了你的手臂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "無妨。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "相信我。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "遲疑片刻後，Mon3tr鬆開了你的手臂，但還是緊緊地跟在你的身旁，寸步不離。\n你與普瑞賽斯並肩而立。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這些城市的傷痕如此不和諧。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你放任這些多餘的參數混雜在你的數據中。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "{@nickname}，那些不起眼的字元，最終使得整個程式癱瘓……我們無法保證一套語言能夠永遠完美地運作下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道你想說什麼，即使是源石，這套由我們創造的語言也依舊存在局限。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它需要更多的時間去調整，去自我迭代。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "甚至有時我會忍不住胡思亂想，真正限制源石向完美形態演化的因素，或許並非其自身的設計瑕疵……而是我們自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人類的感性，抑或理性，都有可能為語言的發展套上枷鎖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "創造源石的那段歲月裡，我們也曾數次辯論過這個主張，但從無定論。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幸好我們都接受這個不確定性存在於源石之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……我不理解你的意思。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……記憶損傷可能也影響到了你發散思考的能力？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過能看到你困惑的樣子，我很開心。這與過往我和{@nickname}的交流模式截然不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "完美，代表著確定的上限。但缺陷，卻代表著我們仍有突破的可能性。這是{@nickname}的主張。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當我們必須解決的危機尚且無法言明時，所謂的完美只是自掘墳墓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "不，這和眼下的情況並無關係。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你……根本無法改變局面。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "這次與我們在甲板上的初遇不一樣。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼時候意識到的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "就在剛剛。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……你本來可以阻止程式炸彈被引爆。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "……你本來可以用源石彌合那道鴻溝。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "background",
              "backgroundId": "61_g8_catastrophicsquare"
            },
            {
              "type": "background",
              "backgroundId": "61_g10_fadedbalcony"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "……你本來可以讓聖徒們永遠受困於迷宮。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "background",
              "backgroundId": "61_g6_pcsderivativemaze"
            },
            {
              "type": "background",
              "backgroundId": "61_g10_fadedbalcony"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "對你來說，做到這些輕而易舉。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "就像你甦醒時帶給羅德島的災難那樣。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "甚至你沒有從一開始就徹底解決我和Mon3tr。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你的狀態出了問題。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這並不難看出來，{@nickname}。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但直到此刻，你才敢鼓起勇氣與我並肩而立。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我更希望此刻站在我身邊的人，能平和地與我分享漫長休眠中，深深扎根於我們心靈深處的孤獨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……可惜，你做不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們的狀態都不如以往。發生了太多事情，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你的確沒有向我隱瞞任何事情。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你更像是一個……呃，謎。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對我有了更多好奇？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在的“Mon3tr”不再有任何的限制，她可以向你解答一部分的困惑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "AMa-10，你在害怕{@nickname}瞭解真相嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過我更希望{@nickname}親自來找我，就像剛才一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在石棺中的日子很難熬。思維如同懸浮在稠膩的泥沼中，我被動失去了對時間流淌的感知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "少有的慰藉是不斷重複烙印在我們思維中的辯論，但並不是為了堅定我們共同立下的願景……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我從不質疑我的道路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“辯論”，這是僅有的還能再與那個人交流的機會——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我——",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我並不奢求你現在就能理解我所思考的事情。在最後的日子到來之前，你都可以繼續你所堅信的道路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們間的分歧注定延續，哪怕你都不再記得當初那人反對我的理由是什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很期待你所愛的泰拉還能如何向我證明，你們的掙扎仍有價值……就像方才拉特蘭的人們一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，我同樣確定，預言家會歸來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，{@nickname}，我會等著你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "遠望著這座了無生機的城市，她嘆了一口氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有時，我會覺得他們太像我們。如果你的時間還足夠，說不定——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她的身影開始淡去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，我的確可以修好AMa-10。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你下定了決心，向源石許願吧，{@nickname}。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會聽到你的聲音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "普瑞賽斯的身影已經徹底消失，你們失去了目標。\n寂靜，絕對的寂靜，只剩下你與Mon3tr，受困在這座褪色的死城之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "她離開了……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，所以這樣就算是結束了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "也許吧。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "薩科塔們自己解決了這場危機。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我也確定了普瑞賽斯目前的狀態。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "她對源石權限的失控比我們預想的更嚴重。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，這是非常珍貴的情報！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然無法確定她恢復到正常狀態還需要多久時間，但至少，我們有了阻止她的可能性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，她剛才提到的……凱爾希……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Mon3tr，我並不信任普瑞賽斯。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我們不應向源石許願，哪怕是為了凱爾希……",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我知道。我也不會同意用她所說的方式把凱爾希帶回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她給羅德島、給拉特蘭造成了慘痛的損失，她的每一次出現都在顛覆我們的認知，也指向更不可知的危機……我看不透她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我們已經研究了那麼久……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我們有自己的方法。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們接下來要走的，會是一段很長的路，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你終於注意到了Mon3tr的異常。敵人已經退去，危機已經解除，但這個原本活潑的少女卻一反常態地沒有露出笑容……\n她的表情甚至有些凝重。\nMon3tr重組的時間還太短，你並未完全適應她如今的模樣，她也還來不及去適應發生在自己身上的變化和那些痛入骨髓的失去……\n但她又太快地投入到了一項又一項任務中，重建羅德島、救援拉特蘭……或許直到現在，她才終於有機會說些什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "別這麼悲觀，Mon3tr——",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "別放棄，Mon3tr——",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會把凱爾希帶回來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也會保護阿米婭，保護你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mon3tr抬頭看向你，突然打斷了你的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不會忘記，凱爾希對我說過的話！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我最不願見到的情況真的發生，如果我最不願見到的那個人重新站在我們面前——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "保護博士，保護阿米婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只會將這條指令刻印進你的基本行為策略之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "……\n……\n永恆的生命注定是孤獨的，我已品嚐過其中的滋味。\n……你也能自己走下去吧——\nMon3tr。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "聽我說，Mon3tr。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你看著眼前的Mon3tr，緩緩開口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你重組身體的時間還太短……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "別給自己太多壓力。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "凱爾希也不會希望她的希冀變成枷鎖。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃……我想你誤會了，博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然我一直記得我剛甦醒的時候，你對我說“歡迎回來”後，竟然就轉頭走掉了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "嗯……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "抱歉，Mon3tr。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係，我需要時間去適應彼此依存了千萬年的共生體的消失，你也需要時間去接受一個並肩戰鬥那麼久的同伴的離開，以及……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們正站在彼此面前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但博士，我們已經認識很久了，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在倫蒂尼姆的炮火裡，在涉入薩卡茲秘辛的洞穴深處，在特里蒙那環形巨大結構升空的尾焰下，在彌利亞留姆的鬥智場中……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希一直在，我就一直在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我並不是在凱爾希離去那時起，才開始遵行她的指令，理解你，理解羅德島。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "成為羅德島的幹員，對抗我們的造主，保護阿米婭，保護你——這同樣是我自己的選擇……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和一直在做的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沉默。\n你看向Mon3tr，沉默將你們兩人連結在一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "那麼，我也是，Mon3tr。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我們會把凱爾希帶回來。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我們會走完那未知的長路。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "永恆的生命注定是孤獨的，但恰好每一段旅程我們都不曾獨行。哪怕生命失色，哪怕萬物殞滅……\n……我們能，也必須一起走下去——\n她這樣希望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "怎麼了？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "還有什麼問題嗎？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這是什麼表情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，指揮官，心理輔導已經結束了！我只是終於想到要怎麼從這個鬼地方出去……我需要你的幫助！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按照普瑞賽斯的說法，這裡應該是那台機器接入源石之後演算出來的空間，某種根據未來圖景的預演。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "所以也和源石的特性有關。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "也許可以嘗試突破那些異常的節點。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "異常的節點？你是說那些映射出破壞痕跡的地方……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你和那台機器之間連接的限制應該被取消了？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，我能感知到它的訊號正在迅速衰弱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我會嘗試恢復與它的連接……\n接下來呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "重複向它發出重構異常節點的請求。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "耗盡它的算力。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有普瑞賽斯的干預，這對我而言不算太複雜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g10_laterano_roof"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "色彩從這座褪色死城的廢墟中溢了出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g9_laterano_street"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g11_laterano_alley"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g10_laterano_roof"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "以啟示石塔右側的街道為起點，經米迦萊昂區的公證所與大大小小的銃械工坊、聖馬爾索區的夕輝禮拜堂，一路向教堂廣場……\n喧囂重歸聖城。\n那是拉特蘭人為生命祈禱的聲音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "顏色……都回來了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "走吧，Mon3tr。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不去跟能天使打個招呼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "就不要打擾她和家人朋友團聚了吧。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我們得儘快向本艦同步拉特蘭的變故。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "普瑞賽斯只是暫時消失了而已……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "普瑞賽斯很快便會有新的動作。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我們的任務還沒結束呢。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（未知語言）我核驗過你的底層程式碼，除了我重新調整維護的部分以外，在短時間內你自行更新疊代了更多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（未知語言）這仍不足以使你修復自身的邏輯漏洞？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（未知語言）我本來還對你自我疊代的結果有極大的興趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（未知語言）現在看來，你錯誤地將自己視作了那個漏洞、那個悖論。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（未知語言）這是以超頻狀態執行的副作用？還是在缺少維護的環境裡，長期與薩科塔進行數據交換污染了資料庫？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（未知語言）如果有更多的數據，或許我可以找到答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（未知語言）可惜——我現在能調用的資源，已經不足以將你完全重啟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（未知語言）否則，指揮系統因其對象的意願而自我否定——這個現象足以重新喚起任何研究者對PCS系統的興趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（未知語言）……假如我們還在那個天才們用思想與主張針鋒相對的時代的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "環形的機器不再回應，普瑞賽斯有些遺憾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（未知語言）看來還是需要採取其他手段來繼續推動計劃進度——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "眾多機械方塊組成環形的運算矩陣，它們是機器的核心部分。此刻，它們都已經陷入沉寂。\n可是突然間，其中的一個個體開始震動，金屬的輝光重新在其表面流轉。\n隨後，閃爍著微芒的光環開始浮現。\n自PCS系統的廢墟中，新的“天使”誕生了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（未知語言）……重啟？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（未知語言）不對，沒有任何回應我的跡象，也不符合PCS系統運作的邏輯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“天使”無視了普瑞賽斯，自上方的缺口處迅速上升，很快消失了蹤跡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（未知語言）“天使”的“原型體”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（未知語言）但這套系統只是模仿“天使”的特性而設計，在建造時甚至並未植入任何“天使原型體”的樣本。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（未知語言）新誕生的“天使”？！怎麼會……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蕾繆樂，你手上拿的是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，噴漆罐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g7_mainstreet_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊茵職員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阻隔層空洞的最新檢測數據已經上報給塞雷婭主任了，但裡面有一項我實在是太好奇了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊茵職員A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_530_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看，這好像是個，奇怪的飛行物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊茵職員B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_529_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有總轄構件科參與分析，相信很快就有結論了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊茵職員B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_529_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許這會是個大發現，能夠停留在接近阻隔層高度的飛行物——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“天使”停留在阻隔層的空洞前，它試圖與散落在群星中的個體恢復連繫，但一無所獲。\n它能捕捉到的，唯有深空中活躍的能量體死去後留下的漣漪。\n於是它繼續環繞著這片大地飛行，如同一顆永恆的流星……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_forest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1720_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（未知語言）生命的氣息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1720_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（未知語言）一片尚且年輕的土地……這是毀滅後的新生，還是死亡尚未造訪過這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1720_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（未知語言）我不是已經被那束光所吞噬……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（未知語言）源石記錄了你的資訊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1720_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（未知語言）……“源石”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（未知語言）在那束光來臨之前，結局尚未確定。源石會成為我們的希望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1720_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（未知語言）這裡是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（未知語言）“泰拉”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "普瑞賽斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1718_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（未知語言）同胞，我們並不孤獨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_school"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌亂的青年",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老師，您看到今天最新的報紙了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌亂的青年",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好多礦場都停工了，城裡也有好多地方開始戒嚴了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慌亂的青年",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的父母都被叫去接受審查了……我見不到他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡謝娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_415_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "留在教室裡吧，同學。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡謝娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_415_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會幫你問問，我也想要知道到底發生了什麼事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她安撫完害怕的孩子，隨後收起了孩子手中的報紙。\n短短幾天時間內，無數流言蜚語在城市裡傳播，而最為聳人聽聞的一則卻是——\n“我們的源石礦脈消失了，如果無法再從大地母親的身上獲得更多能源，我們該怎麼度過下一個寒冬？”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡謝娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_415_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "源石……我會搞清楚的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡謝娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_415_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能夠幫助烏薩斯度過寒冬的，唯有我們胸腔內燃燒的血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_barracks"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希爾達，這裡收拾好之後，應該能作為大家新的安置點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希爾達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感謝你們的幫助！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幸好你在修道院的同胞帶來了物資，不然安置工作也不會這麼順利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希爾達，我們還擔心，你回到修道院後會……會丟下我們——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希爾達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，抱歉。回來的路實在坎坷，一路上我聽聞了許多超乎想像的消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "的確難以想像。礦脈、拉特蘭……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "修道院的薩科塔還繪聲繪色地將你回去的景象描述給我們聽呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希爾達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "災異發生的同時他們想要回到拉特蘭，卻被天災擋住了去路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們的光環已經破碎，只能駐留在原地祈禱，為自己、為已經離開的手足……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後你就出現在了他們的面前……一個本來在三年前就失去消息的人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也給他們帶來了希望，希爾達！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希爾達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼，是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希爾達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的確不想大家的希望落空……也許，能有一個固定的庇護所，我們能幫上更多的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但必要的安全措施仍然不可或缺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們這樣大張旗鼓地行動，總會招來一些有壞心思的人。你會很危險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說實話，說不定我們能找到更好的辦法——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "希爾達搖了搖頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希爾達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想要見到她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希爾達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她一定在這片大地上的某個地方……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "希爾達抬頭看向遠方，儘管她知道茫茫曠野不會給予她什麼回應。\n然後她隱約看見了什麼劃過天空。\n流星嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希爾達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……總之，源石不該成為我們絕望的源頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希爾達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我希望為所有受到苦痛的感染者祈禱——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1722_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，祈禱……真的有用嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希爾達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希爾達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但祈禱的時候，我們會想著彼此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希爾達",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1719_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們緊緊相連，我們並不孤獨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "32_RL2_cliffnight"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "伊比利亞海岸線，某處峭壁\n一隻海嗣緊緊地貼附在鋒利的岩石上。\n海風送來了遠處艦船的炮火聲，但海嗣不為所動，只是努力地向上攀爬著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_458_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（興奮地扇動膜翼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_458_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（激動地舒展褶皺）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "終於，海嗣到達了峭壁的頂點。\n迎接牠的，是無比遼闊的陸地，和天空中一閃而過的光亮。\n流星嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_458_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_458_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "…………"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "海嗣有一瞬間的失神，牠疑惑地挪動著身體，觸肢因而碰到了什麼——\n一顆發光的黑色石頭就此滾出峭壁，筆直墜入了海洋。\n海嗣試圖看清那是什麼，但它已被浪濤徹底吞沒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
